    "text": "kadn.com\nwebsite\nLafayette\nLafayette Councilwoman Liz Hebert hosts Cops, Pops, and Pups to benefit Acadiana Animal Aid\n11 hours ago\nA Lafayette City councilwoman brought the community together with a unique event aimed at supporting Acadiana Animal Aid. The event on Tuesday, August 5, combined cold treats and a meet-and-greet with local police officers. Councilwoman Liz Hebert, alongside the Lafayette Police Department, hosted Cops, Pops, and Pups at three locations within her district. The event offered attendees free popsicles, a chance to meet LPD officers, and the opportunity to find an adoptable pet from Acadiana Animal Aid.\n1",
